{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>I will bind them</b> — like אוסירם, only it is from the derived stem (הבנין הנוסף), and they did not exchange the yod for vav, like: ועפעפיך יישירו נגדך, and he did not say אוסירם like אושיבם, אורידם, and they kept the word on its pattern, whose root is יסר, or the future of ייסר. And the meaning: I will bind those who go to Egypt; then they will be as a report to their assembly dwelling in their land."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:31.953105244Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}